{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Amazon 為 Sony WH-1000XM6 無線降噪頭戴式耳機帶來優惠，黑色款現價 US$348，原價 US$459.99，減幅 24%，另有 5 色可選。耳機具備 QN3 降噪處理器、自適應降噪及 30 小時續航，適合通勤使用。Amazon 頁面顯示可海外免運直送，毋須集運地址，可直接送到香港或台灣；現在正是合適的入手時機。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"WH 1000XM6 2\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"642\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WH-1000XM6-2.webp\" width=\"866\"/></figure>\n<h2>Sony WH-1000XM6 無線降噪頭戴式耳機 重點功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>QN3 降噪處理器</strong>：處理速度比 QN1 快 7 倍，並實時優化 12 個麥克風，令降噪效果與通話清晰度同步提升，身處地鐵或街道時更易專注。</li>\n<li><strong>自適應降噪優化</strong>：按環境噪音、氣壓及佩戴方式自動調節降噪強度，連戴帽或戴眼鏡亦能補償，另有自動環境聲模式方便留意周圍動靜。</li>\n<li><strong>30 小時續航與快充</strong>：最長可使用 30 小時，支援 USB-PD 快充，充電 3 分鐘約可用 3 小時，出門前短暫補電亦足以應付日常通勤與辦公使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F3PQHWTZ?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img alt=\"Sony WH-1000XM6 The Best Noise Cancelling Wireless Headphones, Black | HD NC Processor QN3, 12 Microphones, Adaptive NC Optimizer, Mastered by Engineers, Studio-Quality, Up to 30 Hrs of Battery\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31A0PTEZ35L._SL500_.jpg\"/>\n</a>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F3PQHWTZ?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sony WH-1000XM6 The Best Noise Cancelling Wireless Headphones, Black | HD NC Processor QN3, 12 Microphones, Adaptive NC Optimizer, Mastered by Engineers, Studio-Quality, Up to 30 Hrs of Battery</a>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>\n<p>$348.00</p>\n<p>$459.99</p>\n<p>-24%</p>\n</p>\n<p>In Stock</p>\n</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F3PQHWTZ?tag=newmobilelife-20&amp;linkCode=ogi&amp;th=1&amp;psc=1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">立即購買</a>\n</p>\n</p>\n</p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T09:23:54.736545+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":636,"images":2,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-htm